்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அவனை திரும்பாமல் செய்துவிடுகிறேன், நீங்கள் கவலையை விடுங்கள்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-012.md"},{"id":"manohara-s012-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s012","scene_ordinal":12,"transition_audit_id":"T012","speaker_label":"வசந்தா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அவன் தலை என் காலடியில் கிடக்கவேண்டும்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-012.md"},{"id":"manohara-s012-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s012","scene_ordinal":12,"transition_audit_id":"T012","speaker_label":"பெளத்தாயன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஊஹூம்...தலையைக் கொண்டுவந்தால் நமக்கு ஆபத்து. அவனை யுத்த களத்திலேயே கொன்று அவனுடைய போர்வாளை உங்களிடம் காட்டுகிறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-012.md"},{"id":"manohara-s012-d010","scene_id":"manohara-s012","scene_ordinal":12,"transition_audit_id":"T012","speaker_label":"வசந்தா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்—பழியை பகைவர்கள்மீது போட்டுவிட வேண்டும். மனோகரனின் சாவு மர்மமாகவே இருந்து விடும்—","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-012.md"},{"id":"manohara-s012-d011","scene_id":"manohara-s012","scene_ordinal":12,"transition_audit_id":"T012","speaker_label":"பெளத்தாயன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-012.md"},{"id":"manohara-s012-d012","scene_id":"manohara-s012","scene_ordinal":12,"transition_audit_id":"T012","speaker_label":"வசந்தா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உமக்கு ஆயிரம் பொன் பரிசு!......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-012.md"},{"id":"manohara-s012-d013","scene_id":"manohara-s012","scene_ordinal":12,"transition_audit_id":"T012","speaker_label":"பெளத்தாயன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மணி, நான் போர் வாளைக் கொண்டு வருவேன், நீங்கள் பொன் மூட்டையை......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-012.md"},{"id":"manohara-s012-d014","scene_id":"manohara-s012","scene_ordinal":12,"transition_audit_id":"T012","speaker_label":"வசந்தா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பூரிப்பான செய்தி—கொண்டுவரும்—பொன் என்ன, வைரங்களை அள்ளித் தருகிறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-012.md"},{"id":"manohara-s012-d015","scene_id":"manohara-s012","scene_ordinal":12,"transition_audit_id":"T012","speaker_label":"பெளத்தாயன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரியம்மா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-012.md"},{"id":"manohara-s012-d016","scene_id":"manohara-s012","scene_ordinal":12,"transition_audit_id":"T012","speaker_label":"வசந்தா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஜாக்கிரதை......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-012.md"}]}